    "body": "Avoid acquiring a read lock for every comparison in the sort function by caching the current time.\r\n\r\nAvoid resorting the announce list when updating an entry that was already active, as its relative position (based on distance) remains unchanged.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2967)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
